":"Picard, Troi og Geordi holdes fanget af Data, som har forladt Enterprise og sluttet sig til sin onde bror, Lore, for at lede borgerne.","c":["Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6a9011bd763ed26aa4fb10fb/tile_1787826621650.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S07E01"},{"s":1795920677,"e":1795923973,"t":"Star Trek: The Next Generation","st":"Phantasms","d":"Datas første mareridt bliver virkelighed for resten af besætningen.","c":["Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6a9011bd763ed26aa4fb10fb/tile_1787826621650.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S07E06"},{"s":1795923973,"e":1795927297,"t":"Star Trek: The Next Generation","st":"Encounter At Farpoint - Part 1","d":"Enterprises besætning stilles for retten af et mystisk væsen ved navn \"Q\" for hele menneskehedens forbrydelser.","c":["Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6a9011bd763ed26aa4fb10fb/tile_1787826621650.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S01E01"}]